1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,852
An American soldier

2
00:00:00,852 --> 00:00:02,272
is stranded deep in enemy

3
00:00:02,272 --> 00:00:02,756
territory.

4
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,167
His unit is wiped out,

5
00:00:04,167 --> 00:00:05,533
and he is badly wounded.

6
00:00:05,741 --> 00:00:06,837
But the most incredible

7
00:00:06,837 --> 00:00:08,207
part: he will be saved

8
00:00:08,207 --> 00:00:10,052
by a man he barely knows.

9
00:00:10,556 --> 00:00:11,852
John Kinley serves

10
00:00:11,852 --> 00:00:13,148
in Afghanistan alongside

11
00:00:13,148 --> 00:00:14,644
his interpreter, Ahmed.

12
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:15,917
During a dangerous

13
00:00:15,917 --> 00:00:17,000
operation, their unit

14
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:17,922
is ambushed.

15
00:00:18,074 --> 00:00:19,746
John and Ahmed are

16
00:00:19,746 --> 00:00:21,200
the only survivors.

17
00:00:21,519 --> 00:00:22,654
Ahmed refuses to leave

18
00:00:22,654 --> 00:00:24,074
him, and for days carries

19
00:00:24,074 --> 00:00:25,210
the wounded soldier across

20
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:25,778
the mountains,

21
00:00:25,778 --> 00:00:27,439
until he finally reaches

22
00:00:27,439 --> 00:00:28,885
an American base.

23
00:00:29,241 --> 00:00:30,384
John returns home,

24
00:00:30,384 --> 00:00:31,907
but learns that Ahmed

25
00:00:31,907 --> 00:00:33,812
and his family are still

26
00:00:33,812 --> 00:00:34,774
in danger.

27
00:00:35,019 --> 00:00:36,472
The visas they were

28
00:00:36,472 --> 00:00:37,562
promised never came

29
00:00:37,562 --> 00:00:38,126
through.

30
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,259
So John decides to go back

31
00:00:40,259 --> 00:00:41,519
to Afghanistan and save

32
00:00:41,519 --> 00:00:42,348
his friend.

33
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:43,855
Together with Ahmed's

34
00:00:43,855 --> 00:00:45,497
family, they try to reach

35
00:00:45,497 --> 00:00:46,681
the extraction point.

36
00:00:47,111 --> 00:00:48,123
The enemy closes in,

37
00:00:48,123 --> 00:00:49,895
and there seems to be no way

38
00:00:49,895 --> 00:00:50,463
out.

39
00:00:50,463 --> 00:00:52,431
Just when hope is almost

40
00:00:52,431 --> 00:00:53,796
gone, help arrives.

41
00:00:53,796 --> 00:00:55,494
John keeps his promise

42
00:00:55,494 --> 00:00:58,040
and saves the man who once

43
00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,000
saved him.

44
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,000
A PROMISE IS A PROMISE.

